Step 1 — Check Cowrie's command handling

In a new Kali terminal, run:
    cd ~/cowrie
    grep -n "def.*exec\|def.*input\|display.*output\|send.*data" src/cowrie/shell/command.py

Step 2 -— Find the command output handler
    cd ~/cowrie
    grep -R -n "class .*Command\|def lineReceived\|def handle_INPUT\|def call_command" src/cowrie/shell/
